# Purpose/owner: control-service MongoDB source grants, transport, limits and secret-file references.
# Type: absolute UTF-8 path to a private JSON file (schema.json); no units. Optional; absent disables MongoDB.
# Allowed: existing 0600 file in an owned 0700 nonsymlink directory. Empty, missing file or invalid JSON fails startup.
# Secret handling: this is a file reference, not a URI/password. JSON references private URI files; never embed credentials.
# Precedence: explicit serve --env-file overrides control.yaml mongodb_config_file; ambient process environment is ignored.
# Compose: include in the existing private policy file selected by base/workspace-policy.yaml and mount JSON/URI/CA files
# under the existing private configuration bind. Helm: configuration.policyEnvironmentFile selects the projected private file.
# Effect: restart control after changing any source, credential reference, TLS, deadline, cursor or import policy; no rebuild.
PROJECT_ONE_MONGODB_CONFIG_FILE=/run/projectone/private/mongodb.json
